   "id": "pmt/pure-core-1/ch1/q1",
   "question": "<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li><p>The complex number <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w\"></span> is given by</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"w=\\frac{p-4\\mathrm i}{2-3\\mathrm i}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span> is a real constant.</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li>Express <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a+b\\mathrm i\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> are real constants.<br>Give your answer in its simplest form in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Given that arg <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\"></span><br>find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol></li><li><p>The complex number <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\"></span> is given by</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z=(1-\\lambda\\mathrm i)(4+3\\mathrm i)\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda\"></span> is a real constant.<br>Given that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"|z|=45\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>find the possible values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda\"></span><br>Give your answers as exact values in their simplest form. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p></li></ol>",
